mode.description:
List with one active type of buy. Values vary depending on the type.
Only [ppl, sov, average_sov] modes are supported for proposal items with dynamically selected screens.
Information: ppl: {saturation: number, bs_saturation: number}, sov: {sov: float}, takeover: {sov: float}, average_sov: {sov: float, distribution: ["day", "screen_day", "campaign"]}, goal_impression: {impressions: int, budget: float, cpm: float}, goal_budget: {impressions: int, budget: float, cpm: float}, goal_repetitions: {repetitions: int}
